## Authority calculus

`SELECT` chooses an admitted route. `CONSTRUCT` manufactures reversible artifacts and intents. `DO` changes external state and has no ambient authority. Every DO transition passes BRCE and emits a receipt binding identity, authority, consequence, replay, and standing.

